Experimental Design Notes

Current Objective

Determine the smallest rigorous experimental design capable of answering the project's primary research question.

---

Core Experimental Principle

The vehicle scenario should remain as constant as possible between conditions.

The main difference should be the explanation design.

For example:

Same scenario
Same vehicle action
Same visual environment
Same task
Same event timing

        ↓

Different explanation condition

This improves internal validity.

